{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X的纵向交替和感受短词比较密集，尤其S02、S04、S06、S14，快速扫读不如Y的左右分栏轻松。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右分栏更容易扫读，叙事句子也比较顺，但X用关键词高亮，让每段的心理转折更容易被抓住，而且保留了更多人物内心的矛盾、顾虑及其因果关系。X还通过水波、小船、漂浮、靠岸等意象形成前后呼应，并把声部、力度、音色和乐句变化对应到具体感受上，听起来更有层次，也更能感到情绪是怎样一步步变化的。X的主要代价是阅读负担较重，但综合来看，我更愿意选X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1f678f02-28ba-44a5-90f3-31e0e700f048", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T230518456831Z", "elapsed_seconds": 154.672, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:07:53.133324+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8b8a2a7857697cb58ddab95d27f5a95415ae77f46f7a3abedf98b53a5a163e96", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachmen